  "vector_memory": {
    "semantic_summary": "AudioCache is a core service responsible for managing audio assets, providing both in-memory caching for low-latency sound effects and background streaming for long tracks. It abstracts the Web Audio API, utilizing an LRU eviction policy to manage memory usage against a configurable byte limit. The class handles asset loading via fetch, decoding, and provides specific methods for stream management using HTMLAudioElement."
  },
